{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 16 00}Yeah,{01 00 00 05 00} I guess you're right.{01 00 00 14 00}
It IS a little depressing,
{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.
{07 0b 00}But don't we talk about
this{01 00 00 05 00} every time we run
into each other?{07 00 00}{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 16 00}Jah,{01 00 00 05 00} vist on sul õigus.{01 00 00 14 00}
See ON natuke masendav,
{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.
{07 0b 00}Aga kas me ei räägi
sellest{01 00 00 05 00} iga kord, kui
kokku saame?{07 00 00}{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 15 00}Did you fall on your head or
something?{01 00 00 0f 00} Everybody
knows I'm the manliest.{09 01 00}{07 00 00}{09 02 00}
{07 00 00}And on top of that, I look
way younger, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 15 00}Kas sa kukkusid pea peale
või midagi?{01 00 00 0f 00} Kõik teavad,
et mina olen mehelikem.{09 01 00}{07 00 00}{09 02 00}
{07 00 00}Ja pealegi näen ma
palju noorem, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 01 00}Oh no, you've got that all
backward!{01 00 00 14 00} You're the one
that looks like me!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 01 00}Oh ei, sul on kõik
tagurpidi!{01 00 00 14 00} Sina oled see,
kes näeb minu moodi!{09 09 00}
